\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Above the clear blue sky,
\par In heaven's bright abode,
\par The angel-host on high
\par Sing praises to their God:
\par \pard\sl240\slmult1   Hallelujah!
\par They love to sing
\par To God their King:
\par   Hallelujah!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. But God from infant tongues
\par On earth receiveth praise;
\par We then our cheerful songs
\par In sweet accord will raise:
\par   Hallelujah!
\par We too will sing
\par To God our King:
\par   Hallelujah!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. O blessed Lord, Thy truth
\par In love to us impart,
\par And teach us in our youth
\par To know Thee as Thou art.
\par   Hallelujah!
\par Then shall we sing
\par To God their King:
\par   Hallelujah!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. O may Thy holy word
\par Spread all the world around;
\par And all with one accord
\par Uplift the joyful sound:
\par   Hallelujah!
\par All then shall sing
\par To God their King:
\par   Hallelujah!
\par \f1 
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

